          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 24 2026 16:38:49 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #edeeec;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Built to work with Stryker’s multi-specialty guidance platform, the Q Guidance System, Mako RPS joins a comprehensive orthopaedic technologies ecosystem designed to bring simplicity, versatility and workflow efficiency across sites of care.</span></span></span></span></p>\n",
