          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Step 2</span>: <b><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\">Pose captures and implant planning</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Capture a flexion and extension pose in the desired limb alignment and laxity that they would like to achieve with their final implants.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Adjust and plan for the Triathlon Total Knee system.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Both &quot;gap balancing&quot; and &quot;measured resection&quot; workflows are available.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 11 2026 14:33:11 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
