              "hideComponent": "false",
              "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 24 2026 16:45:04 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Step 3</span><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">: <b>Bone resection</b></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Mako RPS’s patented active adjustment technology responds to surgeons’ hand movements, guiding the handpiece to stay aligned with the surgical plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Mako RPS integrates boundary control on the tibial cut: once the handpiece reaches the posterior protection boundary as defined by the surgeon’s selected landmark, resection capabilities are disabled.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 06 2026 15:27:59 GMT+0000",
